    "Partial encoding from AK Interleukin-5 Inhibitors Criteria (Nucala\u00ae, Cinqair\u00ae, Fasenra\u00ae; Version 3, updated 09/19/2025, effective 11/1/2025).",
    "Fasenra-encoded indications: severe eosinophilic asthma; EGPA. (HES/CRSwNP/COPD are Nucala-only on this PDF.)",
    "Encoded: closed indication list; FDA age-by-indication (asthma \u22656y, EGPA \u226518y from labeled use); specialty-by-indication; asthma eos/controller/concurrent/not-acute attestations; EGPA \u22654/6 ACR criteria multi-select + steroid status; concomitant-biologic denial.",
    "Not encoded as numeric predicates (attestation only): exact eos cell counts, quantity/days-supply math, hypersensitivity/eye-symptom/vasculitis cautions.",
    "Alternatives: Nucala/Cinqair/Dupixent/Xolair evaluate()-linked where indications overlap. PDL preferred same-class peers (IMMUNOMODULATORS, ASTHMA) attach on fail via market basket; Tezspire evaluate()-linked for overlapping severe asthma."
  ]
